---
# Keep this list focused on correctness, portability, and avoidable hot-path cost.
# See docs/CODING_STANDARD.md for the normative naming, ownership, error, and API policy.
# Exclude avoid-pragma-once: CODING_STANDARD.md explicitly requires consistent #pragma once use.
Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  performance-*,
  portability-*,
  -portability-avoid-pragma-once,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -bugprone-implicit-widening-of-multiplication-result
WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: '(^|/)(core/include|core/src|samples|tests)/'
FormatStyle: file
SystemHeaders: false
...
